                                "sense_id": "6fa1d737-ceff-3ab6-b50e-1dce51f7c957",
                                "text": "1993 August 2nd (5:27pm), “KARL FRIEDRICH BLOSS” (user name), talk.politics.guns (Usenet), “Re: You Americans are Gun Freaks…”, Message ID: <1993Aug2.172724.76557@ns1.cc.lehigh.edu>\nIt seems the weapon of choice in Rostock and other wonderful displays of harmony with fellow humans (NOT) was the Mollie (Molotov cocktail)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "47aee1c2-380d-4b9b-887e-b5f7d81c11b2",
                                "sense_id": "6fa1d737-ceff-3ab6-b50e-1dce51f7c957",
                                "text": "1998 September 30th, “zorbo” (user name), misc.survivalism (Usenet newsgroup), “Re: Suppose the bad guys have tanks?”, Message ID: <6useu0$4911@ns1.netrax.net>\nWould you be willing to sit in an AFV, even the most modern, while I toss a couple mollies onto the engine compartment?"
                            }
                        ]
